{0}
This program is free software under the GNU General Public License version 3 or later, and comes with ABSOLUTELY NO WARRANTY. You can read the licence at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html NOTE: Shown when COPYING is missing next to the program - a broken install. {0} is a file path. Do not translate the URL or the licence name.

EN: Received from N1MM: {0}
    NOTE: Count of UDP datagrams received. Menu entry.
    REVIEW: the machine pass ran a product name into the next word and a space was inserted to separate them. Check that the wording around it reads naturally.

EN: Logged to DXKeeper: {0}
    NOTE: Count of QSOs DXKeeper confirmed. Menu entry.
    REVIEW: the machine pass ran a product name into the next word and a space was inserted to separate them. Check that the wording around it reads naturally.

EN: Last QSO: {0}
    NOTE: {0} is a callsign and time, e.g. "W1AW 14:32". Menu entry.
    REVIEW: the machine pass ran a product name into the next word and a space was inserted to separate them. Check that the wording around it reads naturally.

EN: Received {0}, logged {1}, not delivered {2}
    NOTE: Tooltip under the product name. Windows caps the whole tooltip at 127 characters and it is truncated past that, so keep this short.
    REVIEW: the machine pass ran a product name into the next word and a space was inserted to separate them. Check that the wording around it reads naturally.
